{'symbol': 'CNP', 'date': '2023-04-27 06:25:00', 'title': 'CENTERPOINT ENERGY REPORTS STRONG Q1 EARNINGS RESULTS AND REITERATES 2023 GUIDANCE', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CENTERPOINT ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: CNP) OR “CENTERPOINT” TODAY REPORTED INCOME AVAILABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $313 MILLION, OR $0.49, PER DILUTED SHARE ON A GAAP BASIS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023, COMPARED TO $0.82 OF DILUTED EPS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2022, WHICH INCLUDED THE GAINS ON THE SALE OF THE ENERGY TRANSFER COMMON AND PREFERRED UNITS, IMPACTS ASSOCIATED WITH THE ARKANSAS AND OKLAHOMA NATURAL GAS LDC SALE, AND ASSOCIATED COSTS OF THE EARLY EXTINGUISHMENT.'}